{
 "id": "shz01-vo-03",
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "items": [
  {
   "name": "W01",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "东京八十万禁军教头林冲，为因身犯重罪，断配沧州，"
  },
  {
   "name": "W02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "情愿立此休书，任从改嫁。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "这是林冲留给妻子的休书。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "成亲三年，两人没红过一次脸。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他为什么要休了她？"
  },
  {
   "name": "W06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "那时候，他有一身本事，有一个家。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "直到那天在岳庙，有人调戏他的娘子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他一把扳过那人，拳头举起来——"
  },
  {
   "name": "W09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "却认出，那是上司高太尉的干儿子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "拳头，软了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "连最好的朋友陆谦，也站到了他们那边。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "一把宝刀，把他引进了白虎节堂。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "刺了面，押往沧州。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "临走前，他请人写了这封休书。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他怕自己死在路上，"
  },
  {
   "name": "W16",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "更怕高衙内逼她，误了她一辈子。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W17",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "她哭着问：我清清白白，你为什么不要我？"
  },
  {
   "name": "W18",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他只说：我是好意。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W19",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "岳父说：放你回来时，依旧夫妻完聚。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W20",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "为了这句话，他忍着活下去。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W21",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "沧州下了大雪，压塌了他的草屋。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W22",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他躲进山神庙，草料场却烧了起来。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W23",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "门外是陆谦的声音："
  },
  {
   "name": "W24",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "烧死了，拾他一两块骨头回去交差。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W25",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "回不去了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W26",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他一把拽开庙门。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W27",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "一枪戳倒差拨，再一枪，追倒了逃跑的富安。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W28",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "陆谦被他掀翻在雪里，刀，就搁在脸上。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W29",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "杀人可恕，情理难容！"
  },
  {
   "name": "W30",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "这一回，他没有再忍。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W31",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "再后来，他落草梁山。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W32",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他想接娘子上山，却一拖再拖。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W33",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "派去的人回来说：娘子被逼自尽，已故半载。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W34",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他哭了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W35",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "那封休书，没能护住她。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W36",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "他立下它，只是想让她好好活着。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W37",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "从此，他心里再没有可挂念的人。"
  },
  {
   "name": "W38",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "依旧夫妻完聚——"
  },
  {
   "name": "W39",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.35
   },
   "text": "这句话，他终究没能等到。"
  }
 ]
}